{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17204030","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17204030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1720403001:1":{"text":"Magister, the West District is just up ahead...","source_cn":"梅林大人，前面就是西区了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x02E5329A8F8FE337","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, the West District is just up ahead...","female":"Magister, the West District is just up ahead...","variant_male_record_index":"231238","variant_female_record_index":"231239","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720403002:1":{"text":"If there's no reason for you to head that way, better turn back now.","source_cn":"哎，你们要是没什么事的话，可千万别往前走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26DEE1DAF81D6C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720403003:1":{"text":"Something happened up ahead?","source_cn":"前面是发生什么事了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD9F13BD28D9582E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720403004:1":{"text":"There's a monkey running loose through the stalls, grabbing whatever food it can get its hands on! And it's got a talking parrot up on the rooftops calling out where to go next. They're working together!","source_cn":"前面有猴子到处乱窜，抢摊位上的吃的！天上那只说人话的鹦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x994C27A45030A186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720403005:1":{"text":"And the guards haven't done a thing. They've just been standing there watching it happen!","source_cn":"那些守备军也是，就站那看着，一点用处都没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F916E45251337F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1720403005":{"text":"And the guards haven't done a thing. They've just been standing there watching it happen!","source_cn":"那些守备军也是，就站那看着，一点用处都没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F916E45251337F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720403006:1":{"text":"I know. I've never seen anything like it either!","source_cn":"就是说啊！我活了这么久还是第一次见这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BABF695306E9F39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720403007:0":{"text":"My sweets... it took my sweets... *Sobbing*","source_cn":"我的糖果……被抢走了……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60DC127C93EE7C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720403008:0":{"text":"Look at that. The poor kid's still crying. Maybe it's best if we stay out of this.","source_cn":"你看，孩子都被吓哭了。我们还是离远点吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DE892076EADE008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female